# Graphshell stack lift P2: pictograph's canvas commands and wheel policy drive
# Woodshed's three graph surfaces through Cambium cameras, and pictograph's face measurement
# checks view-layer hit targets against painted nodes after each command.
#
# Drive with WOODSHED_SCENARIO, WOODSHED_CAPTURE_DIR and an isolated WOODSHED_STATE.

log P2: canvas commands over the Session Mere, relationship editor and Related graph
settle 90
act relationship-example
settle 5

# Session Mere overview.
click .workspace-panel Mere
settle 5
click .overview-zoom-in Zoom in
settle 3
assert snap overview-zoom == 1.25
assert snap overview-paint-current == true
assert snap overview-face-missing == 0
assert snap overview-face-offset-max == 0.0000
capture 01_overview_zoomed
click .overview-fit Fit scene
settle 3
assert snap overview-face-nodes >= 1
assert snap overview-face-offset-max == 0.0000
assert snap overview-paint-current == true
capture 02_overview_fit
click .overview-motion-toggle Enable scene motion
settle 3
assert snap overview-motion == true
click .overview-motion-toggle Pause scene motion
settle 3
assert snap overview-motion == false

# Relationship editor.
click .overview-relationship Relationship recipe
settle 5
click .relationship-bind Use selected Card relationships
settle 5
assert snap recipe-valid == true
click .relationship-camera-zoom-in Zoom in
settle 3
assert snap relationship-zoom == 1.25
assert snap relationship-paint-current == true
assert snap relationship-face-missing == 0
capture 03_relationship_zoomed
click .relationship-camera-pan-left Pan left
click .relationship-camera-fit Fit
settle 3
assert snap relationship-face-nodes >= 1
assert snap relationship-face-offset-max == 0.0000
assert snap relationship-paint-current == true
capture 04_relationship_fit
click .relationship-camera-restore Restore view
settle 3
assert snap relationship-zoom == 1.00
assert snap relationship-paint-current == true
assert snap set-cards == 3
# Real wheel notches through the host's wheel path: a plain notch toward the
# top zooms in at the pointer; Ctrl zooms in every wheel mode.
wheel 0 1 lines on .relationship-graph
settle 3
assert snap relationship-zoom >= 1.05
assert snap relationship-paint-current == true
assert snap relationship-face-missing == 0
assert snap relationship-face-offset-max == 0.0000
wheel 0 -2 lines ctrl on .relationship-graph
settle 3
assert snap relationship-zoom <= 0.95
assert snap relationship-paint-current == true
assert snap set-cards == 3
capture 04b_relationship_wheel

# Related graph.
click .workspace-panel Related
settle 5
click .related-camera-zoom-in Zoom in
settle 3
assert snap related-zoom == 1.25
assert snap related-paint-current == true
assert snap related-face-missing == 0
capture 05_related_zoomed
click .related-camera-fit Fit
settle 3
assert snap related-face-nodes >= 1
assert snap related-face-offset-max == 0.0000
assert snap related-paint-current == true
capture 06_related_fit
click .related-camera-restore Restore view
settle 3
assert snap related-zoom == 1.00
assert snap related-paint-current == true
wheel 0 1 lines on .graph-canvas-swatch
settle 3
assert snap related-zoom >= 1.05
assert snap related-paint-current == true
assert snap related-face-missing == 0
capture 07_related_wheel
log P2 canvas commands held on all three surfaces
